MNNPerfCounter contains wrapper code under the MNN Apache License 2.0 and
vendored Google HardwarePerfCounter sources under their original Apache License
2.0 copyright headers.

The vendored Adreno ioctl definitions are derived from Linux kernel driver
interfaces. Their upstream GPL-2.0 and Linux syscall-note files are retained at
`upstream/hardware_perfcounter/third_party/linux/`.

The vendored ARM libGPUCounters/HWCpipe device and counter database are
Copyright Arm Limited and distributed under the MIT license. The MIT license
and original notices are retained in `upstream/libgpucounters/`.

The A7xx event database is derived from Mesa Freedreno register metadata. The
original Mesa files retain their copyright and SPDX notices under
`upstream/mesa/`; the referenced Freedreno sources are MIT-licensed.
